# Bibliography (Cursor)

**Portable rules (all tools):** [`docs/bibliography-styleguide.md`](../../docs/bibliography-styleguide.md) then [`docs/bibliography-project.md`](../../docs/bibliography-project.md).

**Agent index:** [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).

Apply everything in **`docs/bibliography-project.md`** when this rule matches. Shared global mechanics: [`../../../bib-mcp/docs/styleguide.md`](../../../bib-mcp/docs/styleguide.md) when **bib-mcp** is in the workspace.

**`.txt` policy (summary):** local by default; do not commit when reproducible from a public PDF in `bib.bib`; regenerate with `./scripts/ensure-extract.sh`; run `./scripts/sync-txt-gitignore.sh` after ingest; `git add -f` only when no stable public PDF exists. Full detail in the styleguide § Git.
